  "events": [
    {
      "afterStroke": 0,
      "kind": "try",
      "title": "Let’s grow a little afternoon.",
      "text": "This is a recorded tour of our flower painting. We began with a blue vase and warm light, then chose just a few marks after each look. Come lean over the easel with me.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9500
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 3,
      "kind": "notice",
      "title": "Three washes. Plenty of possibility.",
      "text": "These washes stayed soft and left plenty of open paper. Notice how the paper does some of the work for us: the empty areas become light.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1.9,
        "x": 0.43,
        "y": 0.36
      },
      "duration": 8000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 3,
      "kind": "try",
      "title": "Give the blue a place to sit.",
      "text": "Let’s put the vase a little right of center. A darker left side and a greener right side can suggest a rounded shape without tracing every edge.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 6,
      "kind": "notice",
      "title": "A lovely oval—but is it a vase?",
      "text": "Up close, the blue has a pleasing grain and a soft color change. From a distance it is still an oval. A dark opening and a contact shadow will help us recognize it.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.535,
        "y": 0.665
      },
      "duration": 9000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 6,
      "kind": "try",
      "title": "Weight below. A gesture above.",
      "text": "We’ll give it a small rim and cast shadow, then let one stem lean left. Asymmetry gives the arrangement a little life.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 9,
      "kind": "notice",
      "title": "There’s our little vessel.",
      "text": "The opening makes the vase readable, and the shadow anchors it. The first stem bends toward the open space. Let’s follow that gesture with a warm flower.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2.15,
        "x": 0.535,
        "y": 0.54
      },
      "duration": 8000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 9,
      "kind": "try",
      "title": "Three petals, then a look.",
      "text": "Let’s try three broad oil petals. Their stronger bristle texture should stand out against the quiet watercolor. We can decide on the folds after seeing them.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 12,
      "kind": "notice",
      "title": "The paint made an open fan.",
      "text": "These overlapping petals have become a fan. There is also a little gap at the stem. That is useful information: the next marks can join the shapes instead of adding decoration everywhere.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2.3,
        "x": 0.42,
        "y": 0.29
      },
      "duration": 9000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 12,
      "kind": "try",
      "title": "Join it before growing it.",
      "text": "A lower coral petal, a golden fold, and a green calyx will connect the flower to its stem. Small decisions can make a big difference in what a shape means.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 15,
      "kind": "notice",
      "title": "A flower with a place to belong.",
      "text": "The lower petal closes the cup and meets the stem. Now step back: there is still room above the vase for another gesture.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2.15,
        "x": 0.43,
        "y": 0.325
      },
      "duration": 7000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 15,
      "kind": "try",
      "title": "Let the stems decide the spacing.",
      "text": "We’ll add a taller right stem, a shorter outer stem, and one pointed leaf. Their spacing will help us decide where the next blooms belong.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 18,
      "kind": "notice",
      "title": "The bouquet starts to breathe.",
      "text": "The stems spread naturally, and that pointed leaf fills the gap near the neck. Keeping some space between branches lets each shape stay readable.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.565,
        "y": 0.425
      },
      "duration": 8000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 18,
      "kind": "try",
      "title": "A quieter flower up high.",
      "text": "The taller right stem can carry a smaller pale yellow bloom. Let’s keep it more closed than the first flower. Variety can come from shape as well as color.",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8000
    },
    {
      "afterStroke": 21,
      "kind": "notice",
      "title": "A small pocket of light.",
